- **Optimization benchmarks** - Concrete targets (excellent <1.5s, good <2.5s, acceptable <4s) and per-stage metrics (Application.onCreate <300ms, Activity to first frame <500ms)
- **Problem diagnosis** - Systematic approaches to identify bottlenecks in Application.onCreate, Activity startup, and rendering pipeline
- **Monitoring implementation** - Complete Java example with LaunchTimer class tracking Application/Activity lifecycle timing with metric collection points

**Code example from monitoring section:**

```java
public class LaunchTimer {
    // In Application.attachBaseContext
    public static void markAppStart() {
        sAppStartTime = System.currentTimeMillis();
    }

    // In Application.onCreate
    public static void markApplicationCreate() {
        sApplicationCreateTime = System.currentTimeMillis() - sAppStartTime;
    }

    // In first Activity.onWindowFocusChanged
    public static void markFirstFrame() {
        sFirstFrameTime = System.currentTimeMillis() - sAppStartTime;
        reportLaunchTime();
    }
}
```

